            {
                "comment": "If you're into films and music it's perfect because you learn the history of both simultaneously. She was highly knowledgeable about all topics taught and easy to ask questions about stuff. Although you don't really see your grade on canvas the course is taught well enough it doesn't really matter because you'll likely pass. Would recommend!!!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "She is very passionate about the material she is teaching. Everything written on the board is valid for tests which makes the tests very easy. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Professor does not return graded assignments for weeks and goes on tangents not related to topic during lectures. Material is presented in scattered way. She sends out emails as long threads and was very disorganized. A struggle to figure out what is due each week or figure out what we had done.",
